        WHEN `as enacted` THEN                                                                  -- VERSION as enacted
            JUST (`Art 27(5) as enacted the AI Office has developed the template` `the AI Office has developed a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool, to facilitate deployers in complying with their obligations under this Article in a simplified manner`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): see the as-enacted function
        WHEN `as amended` THEN                                                                  -- VERSION as amended
            JUST (`Art 27(5) as amended the AI Office has developed the template` `the AI Office has developed a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool, to facilitate deployers in complying with their obligations under this Article in a simplified manner` `giving deployers the possibility to cross-refer to the data protection impact assessment is relevant` `the template gives deployers the possibility to include cross-references to the relevant sections of the data protection impact assessment or include relevant parts thereof`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): see the as-amended function
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
