DECLARE `Art 27(5) AI Office body` IS ONE OF
    `Art 27(5) AI Office`

DECLARE `Art 27(5) AI Office act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 27(5) develop a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool`
    `Art 27(5) as amended give deployers in the template the possibility to include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment`

-- The AI Office's duty: no time limit is stated. As amended the template, where relevant, also gives deployers the possibility to cross-refer; that second act exists only in the text as amended.
-- src:526 | 5. The AI Office shall develop a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool, to facilitate deployers in complying with their obligations under this Article in a simplified manner. This template shall, where relevant, give deployers the possibility to include cross-references to the relevant sections of the data protection impact assessment or include relevant parts thereof in the fundamental rights impact assessment pursuant to paragraph 4.
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1057 | 5. The AI Office shall develop a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool, to facilitate deployers in complying with their obligations under this Article in a simplified manner.
@ref Art 27(5) (src:526) (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1057)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `giving deployers the possibility to cross-refer to the data protection impact assessment is relevant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 27(5) AI Office body` `Art 27(5) AI Office act`
`Art 27(5) the AI Office's duty to develop the template` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate
    THEN CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN                                                                  -- VERSION as enacted
             PARTY `Art 27(5) AI Office`
             MUST `Art 27(5) develop a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool`
             HENCE FULFILLED
             LEST BREACH BY `Art 27(5) AI Office` BECAUSE "the AI Office did not develop a template for a questionnaire"
         WHEN `as amended` THEN                                                                  -- VERSION as amended
             PARTY `Art 27(5) AI Office`
             MUST `Art 27(5) develop a template for a questionnaire, including through an automated tool`
             HENCE (IF `giving deployers the possibility to cross-refer to the data protection impact assessment is relevant`
                    THEN PARTY `Art 27(5) AI Office`
                         MUST `Art 27(5) as amended give deployers in the template the possibility to include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment`
                         HENCE FULFILLED
                         LEST BREACH BY `Art 27(5) AI Office` BECAUSE "the template did not give deployers the possibility to include cross-references to the data protection impact assessment where relevant"
                    ELSE FULFILLED)
             LEST BREACH BY `Art 27(5) AI Office` BECAUSE "the AI Office did not develop a template for a questionnaire"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut or Art 2(2) cuts the Article off
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 27, "", 0)
